M4 subcircuits
.subckt div a b r2=1k
R1 a b 1k
R2 b 0 {r2}
.ends div
.subckt outer p q
* a nested definition with a local model and parameter
.param rin=500
.model dloc D
.subckt inner x y
R1 x y {rin}
.ends inner
X1 p m inner
X2 m q inner

.ends
.subckt commented n1 n2 ; a header comment
+ rval=2k
R1 n1 n2 {rval}
.ends commented
V1 in 0 DC 3
X1 in out div
X2 in out2 div r2=3k
X3 in out3 outer
R3 out3 0 1k
X4 in 0 commented rval=4k
.op
.end
